        "TileImage": "$($repository 671746f4-eecd-417d-b0cd-1ad49e88f0c2).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternon, 47. Your destination is the remote village of Santa Fortuna, Colombia. Your main target is Catalina Delgado, wife of the now-deceased Rico Delgado.\r\rSfter her husband&apos;s passing, she assumed command of the Delgado Cartel along with her two closest lieutenants: Argeo Rodriguez, foreman at the village construction site, and Dioscoro Avalos Posada, helicopter pilot at the local coca fields.\r\rSo. Three targets, all in different places. Good luck, 47.\r\rI willl leave you to prepare.",
